Copyright and Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception notices are retained in vendor
sources and native/vendor/LICENSE. Native-call assembly instructions are unchanged.

The source subset omits the unused TensorFlow dependency installer and optional
lib-socket, lib-wasi-threads and wasi-nn test build scripts. Missing final
newlines in retained upstream text files are normalized.

Local source changes retained from the MeshCore embedding:
- Classic switch-dispatch interpreter calls hwamr_tick on every opcode.
- EMS pool realloc growth updates free-size, high-water and allocation counters.
- ESP-IDF linear memory allocates from PSRAM.
- ESP-IDF task identity uses xTaskGetCurrentTaskHandle, with guest thread manager
  disabled. Linux retains its normal platform implementation.

The profile disables AOT/JIT, WASI/libc, threads/shared memory, bulk memory,
reference types, SIMD, GC and memory64. Native CMake firmware staging and the
Hew native manifest use this same vendored implementation.

native/hew.h is the public Hew byte C ABI header from hew-cabi/include/hew.h.
